        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>★ Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ms Ester's beautiful and neat house has been mysteriously wrecked in the past few weeks and nobody knows why. Patches of dirt on the carpet, things gone missing, and all sorts of mess keeps happening around the house. The police was called to investigate, a priest was invited to bless the house, and a group of ghostbusters was hired (they were so expensive!) and none of them found anything. How useless!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If this problem isn't solved by the time Ms Ester returns from her short trip, she'll kick you out. You have to find someone who can help: anyone will do, even this unreliable looking, self-proclaimed witch you just randomly met.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3741640/extras/02f1afacf2c55f386767912eb3eebab9.avif?t=1778534578\" width=600 height=511 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">&quot;<i>Pippa is going to save the day! Hehehe~</i>&quot;</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>★ Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Around 15,000 words in total.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 endings: 1 bad ending and 2 good endings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose what to feed Pippa: the food chosen affects Pippa's magical energy, which will influence the story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute character art and cute soundtracks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute dogs!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>★ Credits</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>story, art, programming:</strong> Konayachi</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>soundtrack composer:</strong> Dalton Attig (special thanks to Bristol!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>proofreaders:</strong> S.B.Hunter, ebi-hime, Wan-chan</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>misc. programming help:</strong> an anonymous family member</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>sfx:</strong> freesfx, pixabay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>background art references:</strong> pxhere, minikle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>tools: </strong>ActionEditor3, guiManipulate</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>other software:</strong> Krita, VSCodium</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>engine:</strong> Ren'Py</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This VN is made in a month for Spooktober Visual Novel Jam 2024!</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>★ Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ms Ester's beautiful and neat house has been mysteriously wrecked in the past few weeks and nobody knows why. Patches of dirt on the carpet, things gone missing, and all sorts of mess keeps happening around the house. The police was called to investigate, a priest was invited to bless the house, and a group of ghostbusters was hired (they were so expensive!) and none of them found anything. How useless!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If this problem isn't solved by the time Ms Ester returns from her short trip, she'll kick you out. You have to find someone who can help: anyone will do, even this unreliable looking, self-proclaimed witch you just randomly met.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3741640/extras/02f1afacf2c55f386767912eb3eebab9.avif?t=1778534578\" width=600 height=511 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">&quot;<i>Pippa is going to save the day! Hehehe~</i>&quot;</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>★ Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Around 15,000 words in total.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 endings: 1 bad ending and 2 good endings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose what to feed Pippa: the food chosen affects Pippa's magical energy, which will influence the story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute character art and cute soundtracks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute dogs!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>★ Credits</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>story, art, programming:</strong> Konayachi</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>soundtrack composer:</strong> Dalton Attig (special thanks to Bristol!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>proofreaders:</strong> S.B.Hunter, ebi-hime, Wan-chan</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>misc. programming help:</strong> an anonymous family member</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>sfx:</strong> freesfx, pixabay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>background art references:</strong> pxhere, minikle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>tools: </strong>ActionEditor3, guiManipulate</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>other software:</strong> Krita, VSCodium</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>engine:</strong> Ren'Py</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This VN is made in a month for Spooktober Visual Novel Jam 2024!</p>",
